# Release Log — alice branch (changes from 0.1-alpha)

## 0.2-alice (changes from 0.1-alice)

- Merged bob branch (20 commits): mission control refactor with blackboard
  pattern, StepContext, telemetry publisher, YAML config system, Action/Mode
  enums, tracking log, colored terminal logs, GPS MAVLink streams, target
  height raised to 20m, msgpack dependency.

- `src/bullet_app/missions/target_hit.py`
  Re-applied attitude_at fix on top of bob's blackboard-based code. Uses
  sample.attitude_at instead of TIMESYNC offset mapping, which produced
  negative ages (-106ms) with Isaac Sim causing 100% attitude rejection.
  Bob's mapped_age tracking and rejection counter retained for diagnostics.

### Known limitation

- target_contact() is stubbed to False in Isaac physics — truck hit detection
  is not yet implemented for the Isaac backend.

## 0.1-alice (changes from 0.1-alpha)

1 commit, 1 file changed, +2 / -2 lines.

- `src/bullet_app/missions/target_hit.py`
  Original attitude_at fix (superseded by bob merge + re-applied fix above).
